// Setup-`Any` (I-20, relaxed 2026-08-10): `location Hand on any` prompts for
// one player; the chosen player becomes the location's owner.
player P1, P2
turnorder (P:P1, P:P2)
location Hand on any
location Stock on table

card on Stock:
  Rank(Ace, Two)
    for Suite(Hearts)

stage Setup for current 1 times {
  deal 1 from top(Stock) private to Hand
}
